  "description": "Host-neutral S-100 chart rendering engine: the tile compositor (tile grid, raster tile jobs on the work scheduler, the process-wide tile memory pool, warm disk tile cache, GPU residency, overscale curtain, coverage clipping and overlap suppression) and ChartSessionOptions. Depends on EncDotNet.S100.Rendering.Scene, EncDotNet.S100.Renderers.Skia, SkiaSharp and NetTopologySuite, not on Mapsui or a GUI framework; EncDotNet.S100.Renderers.Mapsui adapts it to a Mapsui map.",
